# Acting in Good Faith (windurst 64): Gantineux (Windurst Waters), the qm1 (The Eldieme Necropolis, at I-10 when the
# zone loads), Eperdur (Northern San d'Oria). A level-10 WAR at Windurst fame 225 (level 4). Available: 10019 option 1
# (nothing), option 0 (the Spirit Incense, begun). Accepted: Gantineux 10020 (the incense); Eperdur without the letter:
# nil (his script: Healing the Land needs San d'Oria fame level 4: nothing; his default 678); the qm1 with the incense:
# 50 (SPIRIT_INCENSE_EMITS_PUTRID_ODOR, the incense taken, the qm1 moved to one of four places by math.randomInt(1, 4));
# the qm1 again (no incense: nil, NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY; trigger walks to wherever it went); Gantineux 10021 (neither
# key item: Gantineux's Letter), 10022 (the letter); Eperdur 680 with a full bag (complete fails: the letter kept), 680
# (completed: fame 40, the Scroll of Teleport-Mea, Pilgrim to Mea; the letter taken). Completed: Gantineux 10023
# (replaceDefault). #eperdur shows 680's kind beside Eperdur's script; #qm1 repeats 50 (the qm1's moves).
lists WindurstWaters/Gantineux/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Gantineux/onTrade WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/10019 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/10021 TheEldiemeNecropolis/qm1/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolis/onEventFinish/50 NorthernSanDoria/Eperdur/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/680
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-83.5,-9.25,3.5 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Windurst 225
item BoneChip
login
trade Gantineux BoneChip x1                   # available: no trade handler either way (no script): nothing
trigger Gantineux                             # fame level 4, level 10: 10019
finish option=1                               # not 0: nothing
trigger Gantineux                             # 10019
finish option=0                               # the Spirit Incense; begun
trigger Gantineux                             # the incense: 10020
finish
warp 126.5,-6.5,97.5 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Eperdur                               # no letter: nil; his default 678 (his script answers nothing at San d'Oria fame 0)
finish
warp -19.6,-1.63,58.4 TheEldiemeNecropolis
trigger qm1                                   # the incense: 50
finish                                        # SPIRIT_INCENSE_EMITS_PUTRID_ODOR; the incense taken; the qm1 moved (RandomInt 1-4)
trigger qm1                                   # no incense: nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp -83.5,-9.25,3.5 WindurstWaters
trigger Gantineux                             # neither key item: 10021
finish                                        # Gantineux's Letter
trigger Gantineux                             # the letter: 10022
finish
warp 126.5,-6.5,97.5 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Eperdur                               # the letter: 680
fill-inventory
finish                                        # the scroll does not fit: complete fails: the letter kept
free-inventory
trigger Eperdur                               # 680
finish                                        # completed: fame 40, the Scroll of Teleport-Mea, Pilgrim to Mea; the letter taken
trigger Eperdur                               # completed: no section; his default 678
finish
warp -83.5,-9.25,3.5 WindurstWaters
trigger Gantineux                             # completed: 10023 (replaceDefault)
finish
